[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":158},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":30},"title","Best Long Distance Relationship Gifts","slug","best-long-distance-relationship-gifts","category","long-distance","seoTitle","Best Long Distance Relationship Gifts: Thoughtful Ideas That Close the Gap","metaDescription","The best long distance relationship gifts: touch bracelets, touch lamps, open-when letters and keepsakes that help you feel close across the miles.","image","/images/4a8c4881-62f8-4eac-980d-8d0eed46804e.webp","imageAlt","A couple connected across the distance with matching gifts","intro","Missing someone 5,000 km away hits different at 2am. The good news: the right gift can make the distance feel a lot smaller. We picked gifts that do one of three things: let you feel each other every day, give you moments together, or turn your love story into something you can hold. Short on time? Our top pick is the TOTWOO touch bracelets: tap yours, and theirs lights up on the other side of the world. Christmas tip: international shipping is slow in December, so order early.","sections",[81,82,83,84],"comparison",{"_45":46,"_47":48},"faq",[31,32,33,34],{"_35":43,"_37":44},{"_35":41,"_37":42},{"_35":39,"_37":40},{"_35":36,"_37":38},"question","When should I order a long distance Christmas gift?","answer","At least 2 to 3 weeks before Christmas if it ships internationally. December shipping gets slow, and nobody wants a gift that arrives on December 28.","What is a cheap but meaningful long distance gift?","Love notes. A postbox of handwritten notes costs little and often makes people cry, because the value is in your words.","Do touch bracelets work in different countries?","Yes, as long as both phones have internet. They connect through an app, so 50 km or 5,000 km makes no difference. Check that both phones are supported before buying.","What is the best gift for a long distance relationship?","Something they use every day. Touch bracelets and touch lamps win because they create a small moment of connection daily, not just on the day you give them.","columns",[78,79,80],"rows",[49,50,51,52,53,54],{"_55":75,"_57":76},{"_55":72,"_57":73},{"_55":69,"_57":70},{"_55":65,"_57":66},{"_55":61,"_57":62},{"_55":56,"_57":58},"label","Distance map print","values",[59,60],"Anniversaries","Very high","Care package",[63,64],"Surprises","High","Video date night kit",[67,68],"Shared time","Medium","Open when letters",[71,60],"Hard days","Touch lamps",[74,64],"A quiet daily sign","Touch bracelets",[77,64],"Feeling close daily","Gift","Best for","How personal",{"_85":143,"_87":144,"_89":145},{"_85":128,"_87":129,"_89":130},{"_85":113,"_87":114,"_89":115},{"_85":86,"_87":88,"_89":90},"heading","Keepsakes for your love story","text","Some gifts are not about the distance. They are about the two of you. These end up on the wall, around the neck, or on the desk, counting down the days until you are finally in the same city.","products",[91,92,93],{"_94":108,"_19":109,"_97":110,"_99":111,"_101":112},{"_94":103,"_19":104,"_97":105,"_99":106,"_101":107},{"_94":95,"_19":96,"_97":98,"_99":100,"_101":102},"name","Best for \"see you soon\": DIY countdown calendar","https://images.pexels.com/photos/14643691/pexels-photo-14643691.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","A desk countdown calendar next to coffee mugs","description","Fill each little box with a note, a photo or a candy. They open one every day until you land. The countdown becomes part of the gift.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H8NXZPWM?tag=relations0237-20","Best everyday piece: puzzle heart matching necklaces","https://images.pexels.com/photos/12427695/pexels-photo-12427695.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two matching necklaces in a gift box","Two halves of one heart, one for each of you. Thousands of buyers love it, and it is a sweet daily reminder that someone out there completes the picture.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BWJ89T6?tag=relations0237-20","Best for anniversaries: custom city map print","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6960385/pexels-photo-6960385.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Framed map print showing two cities","Your two cities, the miles between them, and a date that matters to you. It ends up on the wall, and every time they walk past it, they think of you.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GZLN3D1D?tag=relations0237-20","Turn a video call into a real date","Another \"so... what did you do today?\" call? Not tonight. These gifts give you something to do together, even through a screen, and something fun to open when the box arrives.",[116,117],{"_94":123,"_19":124,"_97":125,"_99":126,"_101":127},{"_94":118,"_19":119,"_97":120,"_99":121,"_101":122},"Best surprise: ready-made care package","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6868621/pexels-photo-6868621.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Open gift box filled with wrapped presents and a letter","A box of cozy treats that arrives like a hug in the mail. Add a handwritten note and a hoodie that smells like you, and it becomes unforgettable.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FVSCH5TB?tag=relations0237-20","Best for video dates: Let's Get Deep question cards","https://images.pexels.com/photos/8512178/pexels-photo-8512178.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Card games and snacks set up for a video date","Thousands of reviews for a reason. Pull a card on your next call and get answers you never heard before. Warning: you might stay up until 3am talking.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PQ14F57?tag=relations0237-20","Gifts made of words (the ones that make them cry)","Texts disappear in the scroll. Handwritten notes stay. These gifts give your partner your words to hold on the hard days, the lonely nights and the \"I just miss you\" moments.",[131,132],{"_94":138,"_19":139,"_97":140,"_99":141,"_101":142},{"_94":133,"_19":134,"_97":135,"_99":136,"_101":137},"Best keepsake to build together: Our Adventure Book","https://images.pexels.com/photos/16605273/pexels-photo-16605273.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A journal and question cards on a table","Every visit, every ticket stub, every photo booth strip goes in here. Bring it each time you meet and add a page. In a few years it becomes the most precious thing you own.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091YKMS28?tag=relations0237-20","Best for words: love notes postbox with 50 mini notes","https://images.pexels.com/photos/7333509/pexels-photo-7333509.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Stack of open when envelopes tied with ribbon","A tiny wooden postbox filled with 50 little notes you write yourself. They open one when they miss you, one when they cannot sleep, one when they need a laugh. Costs little, means everything.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DQVG86TF?tag=relations0237-20","Feel close every single day","These are the gifts long-distance couples rave about, because you use them every day. One tap or one touch, and your partner knows you are thinking of them right now. No texting, no time zones, just a little \"I'm here\" you can feel.",[146,147],{"_94":153,"_19":154,"_97":155,"_99":156,"_101":157},{"_94":148,"_19":149,"_97":150,"_99":151,"_101":152},"Most romantic: LuvLink friendship lamp","https://images.pexels.com/photos/35392792/pexels-photo-35392792.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two glowing lamps connected across the distance","Touch your lamp and theirs glows in their room, in your color. Leave it on the nightstand and you will get a soft \"goodnight\" from the other side of the world every evening. Perfect for: couples in very different time zones.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5WVGVF4?tag=relations0237-20","Best overall: TOTWOO Sun and Moon touch bracelets","https://images.pexels.com/photos/34549909/pexels-photo-34549909.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Matching smart bracelets for long distance couples","Tap your bracelet and theirs lights up and vibrates, anywhere in the world. It is the closest thing to holding hands across an ocean. Why couples love it: you wear it all day, so the connection never switches off. Good to know: it pairs through an app, so check that both phones are supported.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DR2HXMFQ?tag=relations0237-20",{"_159":160},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
